<h2>Novo pedido recebido</h2>
<div class="details-box">
  <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Nome:</span><span class="detail-value">{{name}}</span></div>
  <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Telefone:</span><span class="detail-value">{{phone}}</span></div>
  <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Horário preferencial:</span><span class="detail-value">{{preferredTime}}</span></div>
  <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Assunto:</span><span class="detail-value">{{subject}}</span></div>
  <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">ID do pedido:</span><span class="detail-value">{{requestId}}</span></div>
</div>
<div class="highlight-box"><p><strong>📞 Entre em contacto</strong><br>Contacte o solicitante no horário preferencial indicado.</p></div>
